
  <!-- 1 ─────────────────────────────────────────────── HERO -->
  <section class="hero hero--photo">
    <div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="assets/img/hands-community.webp" type="image/webp">
        <img src="assets/img/hands-community.jpg" alt=""
             width="1600" height="1078" fetchpriority="high">
      </picture>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__panel">
        <p class="hero__badge">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 3.4 9.4 8 10 4.6-.6 8-5 8-10V6z"/></svg>
          A Flagler County 501(c)(3) since 2009
        </p>

        <h1>Treatment costs a fraction of a prison cell — and it gives our neighbors their lives back.</h1>

        <p class="hero__lede">
          The Flagler County Drug Court Foundation’s mission is to support and promote the
          Flagler County Drug Court program, helping individuals recover from substance abuse
          and lead productive, healthy lives through community engagement, advocacy, and
          educational initiatives.
        </p>

        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn--donate btn--lg" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate>Donate</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline btn--lg" href="drug-court.html">How drug court works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 ────────────────────────────────────────── GIVING TIERS -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tiers-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Give to something specific</p>
        <h2 id="tiers-heading">Your gift buys a thing, not an abstraction.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          The court supplies the judge, the case manager and the supervision. We supply the
          rest — and the rest is usually what decides whether someone can keep showing up.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier__amount">$45</p>
          <p class="tier__buys">Narcan kits</p>
          <p>
            Two-dose naloxone kits handed out free at community events, to families, and to
            people leaving treatment. We have given these away in Flagler County since 2019.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate data-amount="45">Give this</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier__amount">$3,000</p>
          <p class="tier__buys">A ride to treatment</p>
          <p>
            Missing appointments is one of the most common reasons a person is discharged from
            the program. We pay for electric scooters, gas money, and help with car repairs —
            whatever it takes to get someone there.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate data-amount="3000">Give this</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier__amount">$3,000</p>
          <p class="tier__buys">A graduation</p>
          <p>
            Graduation is what makes finishing feel like something. The Foundation puts on three
            a year, and one costs about $3,000 to hold.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate data-amount="3000">Give this</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="section__head mt-7">
        <h3>Some things you can&rsquo;t put a dollar amount on.</h3>
        <p>
          These matter just as much, and they cost whatever they cost. Give what you can and we
          will put it where it is needed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid--3">
        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier__buys">Rent help &amp; security deposits</p>
          <p>
            Somewhere stable to live is a precondition for finishing the program. We cover
            security deposits and short-term rent so nobody has to choose between keeping a roof
            and keeping their treatment.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate>Give what you can</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier__buys">Specialized treatment</p>
          <p>
            Some people need care the standard program does not cover. We pay for the specialized
            treatment a participant needs so that the plan fits the person, not the other way
            around.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate>Give what you can</a>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <p class="tier__buys">Skills training</p>
          <p>
            Finishing the program has to lead somewhere. We pay for the training and
            certifications that turn a graduation into work someone can actually build a life on.
          </p>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate>Give what you can</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="placeholder mt-6">
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>[CLIENT — ONE COST STILL OPEN]</strong> The three priced tiers
        carry the real figures you supplied. The only number still missing is the <strong>cost of
        one drug test</strong> — send it and testing goes in as its own priced tier. Amounts are
        set in one place, <code>index.html</code> (<code>data-amount</code>).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 ───────────────────────────────────────────── OUTCOMES -->
  <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="outcomes-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">What the program produces</p>
        <h2 id="outcomes-heading">The Flagler County Drug Court Foundation, by the numbers.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          We publish our own results rather than borrowing national averages.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__figure">[&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;]</p>
          <p class="stat__label">People who have graduated from the Flagler County Drug Court program since 2009</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__figure">[&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;]%</p>
          <p class="stat__label">Completion rate for people who enter the program</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__figure">[&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;]%</p>
          <p class="stat__label">Re-arrest rate for graduates, compared with [&nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp;]% for similar cases that did not go through drug court</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="placeholder mt-6">
        <p class="mb-0"><strong>[PLACEHOLDER — DO NOT PUBLISH UNTIL VERIFIED]</strong> These three
        figures are blank on purpose. Nobody invented them. Source them from the Seventh Judicial
        Circuit drug court coordinator or the Office of the State Courts Administrator, and note
        the date range they cover so we can label the numbers accurately on the page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 ─────────────────────────────────────── MONTHLY GIVING -->
  <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="monthly-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Club 100 — our monthly circle</p>
          <h2 id="monthly-heading">$10 a month sustains one person's support for a year.</h2>
          <p>
            A single gift helps once. A monthly gift is what lets us tell a case manager
            <em>yes</em> in the middle of February, when someone needs a ride, a test, or a
            kit and there is no grant cycle coming.
          </p>
          <p>
            Club 100 is exactly what it sounds like: a hundred neighbors giving $120 a year —
            $10 a month — so that the Foundation always has something in hand. It is the most
            useful money we receive.
          </p>
          <div class="btn-row mt-5">
            <a class="btn btn--donate btn--lg" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate data-amount="10" data-monthly="true">Give $10 a month</a>
            <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html">Other amounts</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Club 100 members</h3>
            <p>Local businesses and neighbors already giving at this level.</p>
            <div class="logo-wall" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)">
              <img src="assets/img/sponsor-MinuteManPress.webp" alt="Minuteman Press" loading="lazy" width="400" height="122">
              <img src="assets/img/sponsor-EaglePest-2.webp" alt="Eagle Pest Solutions" loading="lazy" width="400" height="107">
              <img src="assets/img/sponsor-JobOne.webp" alt="Alan Lowe LLC" loading="lazy" width="400" height="167">
              <img src="assets/img/sponsor-GoodVibes.webp" alt="Good Vibe Energy &amp; Nutrition" loading="lazy" width="400" height="217">
              <img src="assets/img/sponsor-Coastal-church2.webp" alt="Coastal Family Church" loading="lazy" width="400" height="219">
            </div>
            <p class="field__help mt-5">
              Business sponsors are listed here and thanked at the annual Ride for Recovery.
              <a href="ways-to-give.html#business">Sponsor as a business →</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 ────────────────────────────────────── NARCAN TRAINING -->
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="narcan-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__grid">
        <div class="hero__media">
          <picture>
            <source srcset="assets/img/narcan-outreach.webp" type="image/webp">
            <img src="assets/img/narcan-outreach.jpg"
                 alt="The Foundation's outreach table at a Flagler County community event, with free Narcan and information handouts laid out under a canopy."
                 loading="lazy" width="1200" height="1200">
          </picture>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Free, public, no questions asked</p>
          <h2 id="narcan-heading">Learn to reverse an overdose in about twenty minutes.</h2>
          <p>
            In 2019 we became the first local nonprofit to secure a Florida Department of
            Children and Families grant to hand out Narcan at no cost. Since then we have
            trained county departments and school district staff, and we still give kits away
            at community events.
          </p>

          <div class="callout callout--gold">
            <h3>Next Narcan training</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
              <strong>[NEXT CLASS DATE — CLIENT TO SUPPLY]</strong><br>
              Date, time, and location to be confirmed by the Foundation.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="btn-row mt-5">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="narcan.html">Narcan training &amp; free kits</a>
            <a class="btn btn--outline" href="contact.html?subject=narcan">Ask about a class</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

